WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
OpenFUSE. A native Rust editor for legacy amplifier presets.

00:02.000 --> 00:04.650
Drag Gain in the real native editor.

00:04.650 --> 00:06.650
Choose another delay model.

00:06.650 --> 00:09.000
Toggle the effect, then undo. Your edits stay local.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
Search the local collection, open Glass room and inspect its details.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
Assign an expression parameter and adjust heel and toe.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.000
USB simulator: review temporary audition, read it back, view simulated tuning.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.000
Manage local backing tracks and choose computer audio output. Synthetic device list.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
Light and dark appearance. Open source. Local first. No amplifier audio in this demo.
